  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I really like the option to be in the lineup outside the club. Get a chance to interact with other avatars in a similar situation. when I go to the void club and it says there are 115 people in the world and I go and there’s no one it’s very disruptive to my immersion. Would much prefer to be stuck outside in the lineup waiting to get into a club that was packed as an option  rather than going into an empty instance. This is especially important if you’re trying to connect with friends at a certain world.",
